		(property "Sourcing_Note" "Sits on PREVGL at roughly -20V. Rated 50V so that DC-bias derating at 20V still leaves useful capacitance - a 25V X7R at 20V retains very little. Same 0603 land, but the body is 1.00mm max thick against 0.90mm for the 25V part it replaced."
