		(property "Sourcing_Note" "Flying capacitor in the panel's charge pump, coupling the boost switching node to the junction of the rectifier diodes that feed PREVGL and PREVGH. Section 1.6 of the panel datasheet specifies 4.7uF/50V in this position and the node works between rails at roughly -20V and +20V, so the 50V rating is required rather than precautionary. This replaces a 10V 0402 part that was under-rated for the node. Note the 1206 body is 1.80mm max thick, which makes this the tallest component on the board - the charge-pump inductor is 1.5mm."
			(at 0 0 180)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "f9ebdfee-7182-4d98-9e0f-9a727cb67a62")
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1 1)
					(thickness 0.15)
				)
			)
		)
