		(property "Sourcing_Note" "Replaces the NR3015T100M suggested in boards/README.md, which Digi-Key lists as Obsolete with a last-buy date of 2026-03-31. The SRN3015TA considered first is marked by Bourns as not recommended for new designs, so this is the current SRN3015BTA series instead - same 3.0x3.0x1.5mm semi-shielded outline, same price, and better rated at 1.5A Irms / 1.0A Isat against 800mA / 750mA. Footprint is the Bourns recommended land from the SRN3015BTA datasheet: 3.5x3.5mm overall, 1.3mm wide pads on a 0.9mm gap, drawn as smart_compass:L_Bourns_SRN3015BTA. Note this land is larger than the 3.2x3.2mm the TA series wants and than the L_Taiyo-Yuden_NR-30xx land, so allow 3.5mm square of clear copper."
			(at 0 0 270)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
